Objective
The objective of Level 11 is to decode the password stored in data.txt.
The password is encoded using ROT13.

PROCEDURE:
Step 1 — Check the file
ls
You should see:
data.txt
Step 2 — View the encoded text
cat data.txt
You will see the password in an encoded form.
Step 3 — Decode using ROT13

Use:
cat data.txt | tr 'A-Za-z' 'N-ZA-Mn-za-m'

This converts each letter to its ROT13 equivalent.

Result
The decoded text is the password required to log in to Bandit Level 12.
Do not include the password in your GitHub README or screenshot.
